0000fc020000ffffff000000040000002d01040004000000f0010100040000002701ffff1c000000fb021000070000000000bc02000000000102022253797374656d000000000000fd99807c58bd1e0010f9230070bb1e005ae78339040000002d010100030000000000}}{
\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15600127\charrsid463556  What is meant by the term \lquote Just-in-Time\rquote  Inventory system?
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15600127\charrsid463556 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa120\sbauto1\sl360\slmult0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1838180 \cbpat8 {\fs28\cf0\ulc0\insrsid12540706\charrsid463556 Ans 50)}{\fs28\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1838180\charrsid463556 
 Pull driven inventory system in which materials, parts, sub-assemblies, and support items are delivered just when needed and neither sooner nor later. Its objective is to eliminate product inventories from the suppl
y. As much a managerial philosophy as an inventory system, JIT encompasses all activities required to make a final product from design engineering onwards to the last manufacturing operation. JIT systems are fundamentals to time based competition and rely
 on waste reduction, process simplification, setup time and batch size reduction, parallel processing, and shop floor layout redesign. Under JIT management, shipments are made within rigidly enforced 'time windows\rquote 
 and all items must be within the specification with very little or no inspection. It was developed and perfected by Taiichi Ohno of Toyota corporation during 1960s.
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa120\sbauto1\sl360\slmult0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12540706 \cbpat8 {\f38\fs21\cf0\ulc0\insrsid12540706\charrsid463556 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\cf0\ulc0\insrsid12540706\charrsid463556 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15600127\charrsid463556     }{\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15600127\charrsid463556 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15600127\charrsid463556 Question No: 51    ( Marks: 5 ) 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx1125\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15295941\charrsid463556 {\pict{\*\picprop\shplid1071{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 75}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}
{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLine}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}\picscalex100\picscaley100\piccropl0\piccropr0\piccropt0\piccropb0
