0000fc020000ffffff000000040000002d01040004000000f0010100040000002701ffff1c000000fb021000070000000000bc02000000000102022253797374656d000000000000fd99807c58bd1e0010f9230070bb1e005ae78339040000002d010100030000000000}}{
\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15600127\charrsid463556  Define the term \'93Material Management\'94. What are the problems faced by materials managers in today\rquote s world?
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15600127\charrsid463556 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4399934 {\fs28\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4399934\charrsid463556 Ans 52) }{\fs28\cf0\insrsid4399934\charrsid463556 
Material Management is concerned with control of materials in such a manner which ensures maximum return on working control. Mate
rial management is concerned with the location & purchase of needed their storage & movement. It also arranges to keep an account for them. It is also responsible for planning their movement through manufacturing processes, store rooms and distribution ch
a
nnels. It is the branch of logistics that deals with the tangible components of a supply chain which covers the acquisition of spare parts/replacements, quality control of purchasing and ordering such parts/replacements, and the standards involved in orde
ring, shipping, and warehousing}{\cf0\insrsid4399934\charrsid463556 .}{\fs28\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4399934\charrsid463556 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15600127\charrsid463556     }{\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15600127\charrsid463556 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15600127\charrsid463556 Question No: 53    ( Marks: 5 ) 
\par }{\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15295941\charrsid463556 {\pict{\*\picprop\shplid1073{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 75}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLine}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}
\picscalex100\picscaley100\piccropl0\piccropr0\piccropt0\piccropb0\picw15584\pich26\picwgoal8835\pichgoal15\wmetafile8\bliptag-1895836859\blipupi-161{\*\blipuid 8effd34580ace9d478c35331c42d728e}
